# Toolchain artifact verification (project rules 13.4.3 / 13.4).
#
# The fetched artifacts are git checkouts from googlesource, so verification is
# content-addressed rather than a plain file hash: the Dockerfile clones each
# repo at a fixed ref and aborts the image build unless the resolved HEAD
# equals the pin recorded here. That pins every blob in the tree, which is at
# least as strong as a SHA256 over a tarball.
#
# Format: <resolved commit SHA>  <repo URL>  <ref used for the shallow fetch>
eed2fff8b93ce059eea7ccd8fc5eee37f8adb432  https://android.googlesource.com/platform/prebuilts/clang/host/linux-x86  refs/heads/llvm-r487747
2208a03d874255af1e4eaf6cf7c156fe1dc98943  https://android.googlesource.com/platform/system/tools/mkbootimg       refs/tags/android-14.0.0_r0.102